{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39110","headline":"题裴端公郊居 · 韦庄","name":"题裴端公郊居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暂随红斾佐藩方，高迹终期卧故乡。\n已近水声开涧户，更侵山色架书堂。\n蒲生岸脚青刀利，柳拂波心绿带长。\n莫夺野人樵牧兴，白云不识绣衣郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39110.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39110","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}